WIRE.md §5.9, §8.1, DECISIONS 308: the same through `emit json`: a value whose record has a dependent field with a Range branch is E8151, not a fingerprint failure.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A kind.
enum K { a, b }

/// The field's type.
type F(k: K) = match k {
  a => Int
  _ => Range
}

/// A row.
record R {
  /// Its kind.
  k: K
  /// Its value.
  v: F(k)
}

/// The row.
let x: R = { k: a, v: 1 }

emit json { out: "out/" }
-- a.x.json --
{ "k": "a", "v": 1 }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8151]  a/a.canon:21:5
  value x of type a.R has no wire form

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
